82
00:08:07,624 --> 00:08:12,624
The children of the village lovingly crafted a statue of your likeness out of clay as a gift.

83
00:08:12,624 --> 00:08:16,624
It's endearing how much love and labor they poured into its creation.

84
00:08:21,624 --> 00:08:22,624
Well...

85
00:08:26,624 --> 00:08:29,624
We made this to show the Snake Princess how much we love her.

86
00:08:31,624 --> 00:08:34,624
It took them forever to bring it up to the castle because it would break if they dropped it.

87
00:08:34,624 --> 00:08:35,624
Don't you think it's cute?

88
00:08:35,624 --> 00:08:36,624
Don't you think it's cute?

89
00:08:40,624 --> 00:08:41,624
It's me.

90
