The size and brute strength of the beast was simply astonishing.

104
00:09:19,624 --> 00:09:21,624
So everyone has left for the jungle to hunt it.

105
00:09:23,624 --> 00:09:24,624
I see.

106
00:09:28,624 --> 00:09:29,624
Let's go.

107
00:09:30,624 --> 00:09:31,624
Let's go.

108
00:09:35,624 --> 00:09:36,624
Let's get into the petty crisis.

109
