Are all men as stubborn as this one?

116
00:10:04,084 --> 00:10:06,404
Do not think you can escape your death.

117
00:10:08,144 --> 00:10:10,204
It's no concern. They'll be back shortly.

118
00:10:10,784 --> 00:10:12,824
I'm truly sorry they weren't there to greet you.

119
00:10:13,364 --> 00:10:14,164
No matter.

120
00:10:15,104 --> 00:10:17,004
Well then, would you care for a drink?

121
00:10:22,224 --> 00:10:23,064
White sake.

122
00:10:23,604 --> 00:10:26,384
Go ahead and make that two while you're at it.

123
00:10:26,384 --> 00:10:27,344
Granny Mion.

124
00:10:27,624 --> 00:10:29,824
How nice of you to defile my private chambers.

125
00:10:30,264 --> 00:10:31,624
I didn't see you come in.

126
00:10:31,844 --> 00:10:33,104
How did you get in here?

127
00:10:33,564 --> 00:10:35,284
Forget how I'm here.

128
00:10:36,224 --> 00:10:37,544
Get rid of her.

129
00:10:37,724 --> 00:10:40,524
Hold on. Listen, snake princess.

130
00:10:51,204 --> 00:10:52,864
You forgot, please.

131
00:10:54,744 --> 00:10:55,864
Now say it.

132
00:10:55,864 --> 00:11:01,084
Please listen, snake princess.

133
00:11:01,084 --> 00:11:05,744
I have just learned that there's a ship from Central anchored off our shores.

134
00:11:06,684 --> 00:11:10,824
They've come here with the express purpose of summoning you, have they, Nyut?

135
00:11:10,824 --> 00:11:14,624
