136
00:11:14,624 --> 00:11:17,984
That's right. They want me to go to war.

137
00:11:17,984 --> 00:11:20,644
Why are you here? You must go.

138
00:11:20,644 --> 00:11:24,244
You must uphold the agreement or they'll revoke your title.

139
00:11:24,244 --> 00:11:29,764
I know you've just returned, but surely you still have the strength to fight.

140
00:11:29,764 --> 00:11:31,624
I do.

141
00:11:31,624 --> 00:11:32,844
But I'm afraid to go.

142
00:11:32,844 --> 00:11:34,004
But I'm afraid to go.

143
00:11:34,004 --> 00:11:36,484
Oh, she's like a weird old puppy.

144
00:11:36,484 --> 00:11:36,864
Wait!

145
00:11:36,864 --> 00:11:38,684
I'm not funny for that.

146
00:11:38,684 --> 00:11:41,004
Nyut, nyut, nyut, nyut, nyut, nyut, nyut, nyut, nyut, nyut, nyut, nyut.

147
00:11:41,004 --> 00:11:47,644
Now, think this through, all that is truly protecting our nation is your title as warlord.

148
00:11:48,364 --> 00:11:53,444
Our greatest deterrence from outside forces is Amazon Lily's location,

149
00:11:53,964 --> 00:11:56,904
here in the Sea King riddled waters of the Calm Belt.

150
00:11:57,384 --> 00:12:00,924
But as time marches forward, so does technology.

151
00:12:01,544 --> 00:12:07,144
And now these central dwellers have ships that provide them with safe passage through these parts.

152
00:12:07,484 --> 00:12:10,044
We need a new weapon to keep them at bay.

153
00:12:10,044 --> 00:12:16,204
Your rank as warlord is the sole reason they avoid our shores, despite the activities of the Kuja pirates.

154
00:12:16,744 --> 00:12:21,264
Think of your people. Our island is home to helpless children and elderly.

155
00:12:21,924 --> 00:12:26,404
If you lost your title, Amazon Lily would just be another nation of pirates,

156
00:12:26,584 --> 00:12:29,244
and the government would bring ruin to us.

157
00:12:31,224 --> 00:12:33,764
Now you're the one who sounds like she's afraid.

158
00:12:34,004 --> 00:12:37,044
I am old. I could drop dead at any moment.

159
00:12:37,044 --> 00:12:40,264
Gaze into this crystal ball and see your future.

160
00:12:41,564 --> 00:12:44,904
Oh my. Her crystal ball is always right about the future.

161
00:12:45,744 --> 00:12:47,404
It's never wrong about anything.

162
00:12:47,664 --> 00:12:49,684
I shall conjure an image of your fate.

163
00:12:49,684 --> 00:13:01,684
Your fortune!

164
00:13:01,684 --> 00:13:01,844
Your fortune!

165
00:13:06,844 --> 00:13:07,764
Huh?

166
00:13:08,644 --> 00:13:09,184
Huh?

167
00:13:09,184 --> 00:13:14,044
You idiot!

168
00:13:15,884 --> 00:13:16,924
Throw her out!

169
00:13:17,024 --> 00:13:18,384
Right now!

170
00:13:18,624 --> 00:13:19,984
Yes, of course, Snake Princess!

171
00:13:20,704 --> 00:13:22,004
Wait! Hear me out!

172
00:13:22,724 --> 00:13:24,024
That's so rough!

173
00:13:24,024 --> 00:13:26,644
I listen respectfully, and you treat me like a fool.

174
00:13:27,144 --> 00:13:29,244
Did you think I'd fall for your chicanery?

175
00:13:29,704 --> 00:13:32,804
Your reign here ended well over three generations ago.

176
00:13:33,384 --> 00:13:36,384
How dare you act like you're still the empress of Amazon Lily?

177
00:13:38,764 --> 00:13:39,244
Gloriosa.

178
00:13:41,024 --> 00:13:43,044
It doesn't matter what I do.

179
00:13:43,044 --> 00:13:45,864
I could lay waste to every inch of this nation of ours.

180
00:13:46,304 --> 00:13:46,944
On a whim.

181
00:13:48,184 --> 00:13:49,044
And still,

182
00:13:49,584 --> 00:13:51,884
I would be forgiven because I'm beautiful.

183
00:13:52,784 --> 00:13:53,264
Amazing!

184
00:13:53,744 --> 00:13:56,044
She looks down on people so much that she looks up!

185
00:13:56,324 --> 00:13:59,644
Why on earth should I listen to the words of a disgraced ruler

186
00:13:59,644 --> 00:14:02,464
who abandoned her people to journey the outer seas?

187
00:14:03,004 --> 00:14:04,124
Traitor to the Kuja!

188
00:14:04,844 --> 00:14:08,024
So I live alone in penance on the outskirts of town!

189
00:14:09,184 --> 00:14:11,664
Which is where you should be at this very moment.

190
00:14:11,664 --> 00:14:14,444
Do not presume to tell me what to do!

191
00:14:14,624 --> 00:14:15,864
I'm the reigning empress!

192
00:14:17,604 --> 00:14:18,604
Snake Princess!

193
00:14:18,884 --> 00:14:20,084
Put me down already!

194
00:14:21,444 --> 00:14:22,384
That said,

195
00:14:22,604 --> 00:14:25,244
I can't help but admire your overwhelming passion.

196
00:14:26,024 --> 00:14:27,184
You may be right.

197
00:14:28,804 --> 00:14:30,844
You agreed to my request?

198
00:14:31,324 --> 00:14:33,844
Thank you for understanding the needs of your people!

199
00:14:34,244 --> 00:14:35,344
How wonderful!

200
00:14:36,064 --> 00:14:36,504
So,

201
00:14:37,044 --> 00:14:38,524
how soon will you be leaving?

202
00:14:38,524 --> 00:14:43,864
Never know your place, fool!

203
00:14:43,964 --> 00:14:44,364
No!

204
00:14:45,064 --> 00:14:47,604
Now get out of my sight!

205
00:14:49,464 --> 00:14:51,504
A curse on you, Snake Princess!

206
00:14:52,264 --> 00:14:52,704
Yeah!

207
00:14:57,484 --> 00:14:58,504
Snake Princess,

208
00:14:58,904 --> 00:15:00,704
you threw an old woman out the window!

209
00:15:00,704 --> 00:15:03,624
What an accident!

210
00:15:04,384 --> 00:15:05,344
Oh, of course!

211
00:15:05,564 --> 00:15:07,004
We know it wasn't your fault!

212
00:15:07,524 --> 00:15:09,284
Now clean up all this broken glass.

213
00:15:09,524 --> 00:15:10,424
Yes, ma'am!

214
00:15:14,424 --> 00:15:16,324
That irritating old hag!

215
00:15:16,324 --> 00:15:30,144
Granny Neon?

216
00:15:30,144 --> 00:15:33,344
I may be old,

217
00:15:33,344 --> 00:15:46,844
but I'm still a Kuja warrior!

218
00:15:47,304 --> 00:15:49,064
My skills haven't withered a bit!

219
00:15:52,324 --> 00:15:53,584
I touched her.

220
00:15:54,544 --> 00:15:56,824
Have you prepared my bathwater yet?

221
00:15:57,024 --> 00:15:57,424
Yes!

222
00:15:57,524 --> 00:15:59,264
I'll issue the advisory immediately!

223
00:15:59,264 --> 00:16:02,564
Your attention, please!

224
00:16:02,744 --> 00:16:05,144
The Snake Princess will now bathe!

225
00:16:12,584 --> 00:16:14,364
Now, stay still!

226
00:16:14,484 --> 00:16:15,284
I'm almost done!

227
00:16:17,524 --> 00:16:18,344
Well, sorry!

228
00:16:19,204 --> 00:16:19,844
Huh?

229
00:16:20,524 --> 00:16:20,844
Huh?

230
00:16:23,284 --> 00:16:25,744
We must evacuate the castle now!

231
00:16:25,744 --> 00:16:28,624
Hey, come on!

232
00:16:28,644 --> 00:16:29,264
We've got to go!

233
00:16:29,344 --> 00:16:30,444
But I just sat down!

234
00:16:30,504 --> 00:16:31,164
I'm still eating!

235
00:16:31,404 --> 00:16:31,884
Come on!

236
00:16:31,944 --> 00:16:32,684
Hurry, everyone!

237
00:16:34,544 --> 00:16:36,024
If you're on duty today,

238
00:16:36,144 --> 00:16:37,344
report to your post!

239
00:16:40,804 --> 00:16:42,504
Sounds like it's bath time!

240
00:16:44,044 --> 00:16:45,204
Get ready, girls!

241
00:16:45,364 --> 00:16:46,884
They're clearing out the castle now!

242
00:16:47,024 --> 00:16:48,424
It's about to get packed in here!

243
00:16:48,424 --> 00:17:03,524
For the next several hours,

244
00:17:03,644 --> 00:17:05,644
no one is allowed to enter the castle

245
00:17:05,644 --> 00:17:07,204
under any circumstances!

246
00:17:11,204 --> 00:17:12,944
What are you doing here?

247
00:17:13,664 --> 00:17:14,984
You know you're not allowed

248
00:17:14,984 --> 00:17:16,044
past the barrier, right?

249
00:17:16,044 --> 00:17:19,024
Yeah, but why is it such a big deal

250
00:17:19,024 --> 00:17:20,204
when the universe takes a bath?

251
00:17:20,364 --> 00:17:21,404
Everyone acts like we're going

252
00:17:21,404 --> 00:17:22,344
to war or something!

253
00:17:23,084 --> 00:17:24,104
First things first,

254
00:17:24,184 --> 00:17:24,784
how old are you?

255
00:17:25,264 --> 00:17:26,064
Eight years old.

256
00:17:26,304 --> 00:17:28,204
Well, then I think I can tell you.

257
00:17:29,364 --> 00:17:30,584
Wait, you don't mean

258
00:17:30,584 --> 00:17:31,544
the secret.

259
00:17:33,044 --> 00:17:33,844
That's right.

260
00:17:37,844 --> 00:17:39,604
You're in charge of keeping watch.

261
00:17:39,744 --> 00:17:41,044
As you wish, dear sister.

262
00:17:41,184 --> 00:17:42,004
Take your time.

263
00:17:42,004 --> 00:17:53,064
You see, the Gorgon was a monster.

264
00:17:54,064 --> 00:17:55,204
It stalked the tides

265
00:17:55,204 --> 00:17:56,264
of the central oceans.

266
00:17:57,264 --> 00:17:58,824
If anyone made the mistake

267
00:17:58,824 --> 00:18:00,864
of gazing upon this horrifying creature,

268
00:18:01,404 --> 00:18:02,764
they would be turned to stone.

269
00:18:04,344 --> 00:18:06,304
After facing countless perils

270
00:18:06,304 --> 00:18:07,604
along a treacherous journey,

271
00:18:07,604 --> 00:18:09,784
the snake princess and her sisters

272
00:18:09,784 --> 00:18:10,804
encountered the monster

273
00:18:10,804 --> 00:18:12,144
and managed to slay it.

274
00:18:13,984 --> 00:18:20,424
But the screams of the dying abomination

275
00:18:20,424 --> 00:18:21,684
were laced with evil,

276
00:18:22,364 --> 00:18:24,504
and it placed the sisters under a curse.

277
00:18:25,224 --> 00:18:26,824
The penetrating eyes of the monster

278
00:18:26,824 --> 00:18:28,384
were etched across the flesh

279
00:18:28,384 --> 00:18:29,544
of the sisters' backs.

280
00:18:30,504 --> 00:18:32,784
So they remain forever staring,

281
00:18:32,984 --> 00:18:33,664
even today.

282
00:18:33,664 --> 00:18:37,244
And if anyone gazes upon these wicked eyes,

283
00:18:37,804 --> 00:18:39,524
their body will harden into stone

284
00:18:39,524 --> 00:18:40,344
and they'll die.

285
00:18:46,784 --> 00:18:48,504
That's why the Gorgon sisters

286
00:18:48,504 --> 00:18:50,004
refuse to remove their clothing

287
00:18:50,004 --> 00:18:51,084
before another human.

288
00:18:52,524 --> 00:18:54,144
As a matter of precaution,

289
00:18:54,464 --> 00:18:55,624
they always post guards

290
00:18:55,624 --> 00:18:56,364
when they bathe,

291
00:18:56,824 --> 00:18:58,824
and they secure and evacuate the castle.

292
00:18:58,824 --> 00:19:00,584
Now listen to that

293
00:19:00,584 --> 00:19:03,244
and they always turn away

294
00:19:20,184 --> 00:19:21,504
in this case.

295
00:19:21,504 --> 00:19:49,984
Sounds like the man's over there.

296
00:19:49,984 --> 00:19:56,984
